# Project graph (token saver)

Trước khi grep/Task explore toàn repo, đọc **`docs/PROJECT-GRAPH.md`**.

Skills:
- Graph: `.cursor/skills/<tên-dự-án>-graph/SKILL.md`
- Explore / debug / impact: `<tên-dự-án>-exploring`, `-debugging`, `-impact`
- GitNexus (mọi dự án): skill global `project-graph-gitnexus`
- Bootstrap template: `.cursor/skills/project-graph-gitnexus/references/`
